        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "From FY 2026-27: Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Pune and Ahmedabad. Up to FY 2025-26 only Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata and Chennai qualified; all other cities use 40%."
      }
